OL,3,GNEWSANHS data breaches a disgrace,
OL,4,Ahealth secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer comments came after Nottingham
OL,7,FUniversity Hospitals (NUH) NHS Trust
OL,8,Fconfirmed it had sacked a total of 15
OL,9,Fmembers of staff and Yorkshire
OL,10,FAmbulance Service said William
OL,11,FChapman's medical records may have been
OL,12,Faccessed illegitimately.
OL,14,FDr Manjeet Shehmar, NUH medical
OL,15,Fdirector, previously said there was
OL,16,F"simply no excuse for accessing the
OL,17,Frecords of a patient without a
OL,18,Flegitimate reason".
